~ start
% Herb Bert: This is always a nice shop to pass by!
% Herb Bert: Greetings, potion seller!
% Herb Bert: Phew, had a rough day of work today.

match Globals.wantedPotionType: # this is a placeholder while we set up a global variable for the wanted potions
	when "Potion of Mogging":
		Herb Bert: I want to look like I outclass the room around me!
	when "Potion of Beautification":
		Herb Bert: I'm going on a date tonight, can you make me more attractive?
	when "Potion of Rapid Shaking":
		Herb Bert: I've got so much stress on me, I need to shake it out!
	when "Potion of Eye Colour Swap":
		Herb Bert: I'm getting bored with my eye colour, can you do anything about that?
	when "Potion of Permanent Smile":
		Herb Bert: People always say I have a bad resting face, think you can deal with that?
	when "Potion of Green Skin":
		Herb Bert: Could you possibly make me green? It's for a costume.
	when "Potion of Curing":
		Herb Bert: I had to cut back some poison ivy the other day, got any cures?
	when "Potion Of Baldness":
		% Herb Bert: I need some help looking more like a monk.
		% Herb Bert: I'm done with having hair. Get rid of it!
	when "Potion of Head Size Increase":
		Herb Bert: If I had a bigger head, would that make me smarter?
	when "Potion of Head Size Decrease":
		Herb Bert: I'm feeling self-consious about my head, could you make it smaller?
	when "Potion of Creature Feature":
		Herb Bert: I'm looking to scare some friends camping in the woods, could you make me some kind of creature?
	when "Potion of Rabies":
		Herb Bert: I wanna play a little trick on a friend, can you help me look like I'm foaming at the mouth?
	when "Potion of Change Language":
		Herb Bert: I'm looking to go overseas, could you help with the language barrier?
	when "Potion of Change Art Styles":
		Herb Bert: I want to see myself in an entirely new way!
	when "Potion of Body Swap":
		Herb Bert: I sometimes wonder what it'd be like to be someone else... think you could help with that?
	when "Potion of Love":
		Herb Bert: I'm going on a date tonight, can you make me more loveable?
	when "Potion of Explode":
		Herb Bert: I got a boomin' harvest today, and I want to match it!
	when "Potion of Skeleton":
		Herb Bert: I'm trying to sneak into a dungeon, can you help me disguise with the monsters down there?
	when "Potion of Enlarge Person":
		Herb Bert: Birds keep stealing my crops, help me catch them!
	when "Potion of Shrink Person":
		Herb Bert: Some rats keep getting into my garden, could you shrink me down to help me fight them eye-to-eye?
	else:
		Herb Bert: I'm not quite sure what I want... (placeholder: no requested potion set)

- Confirm

=> END